  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to episode one of The Naked Director. We open in a bright Tokyo studio before jumping back to where Toru Muranishi started. Kaoru Kuroki speaks politely about living naturally and about love, while Muranishi gets his camera ready to roll. Just listen to the rhythm first without worrying about every detail.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしは日本の風潮に問題があると思っております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "日本には恥じらいの文化がございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "それに縛られる必要はございません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "でも恥ずかしいなんて思いませんよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あるがままに生きることが人間らしさです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしのテーマは愛でございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そして愛とは自然の受容でございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "皆さんにミラクルが起きる瞬間をお見せします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "目を閉じないでください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いいですね？それでは参ります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よーい、アクション！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしは日本の風潮に問題があると思っております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I believe there is a problem with current attitudes in Japan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "日本には恥じらいの文化がございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In Japan, there is a culture of shyness.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "それに縛られる必要はございません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no need to be bound by that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "でも恥ずかしいなんて思いませんよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, I do not feel embarrassed at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あるがままに生きることが人間らしさです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Living just as you are is what makes us human.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしのテーマは愛でございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My theme is love.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "皆さんにミラクルが起きる瞬間をお見せします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will show everyone the moment a miracle happens.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "目を閉じないでください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please do not close your eyes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いいですね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you ready?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よーい、アクション！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ready, action!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
